{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21392","headline":"赋得玉巵无当 · 元稹","name":"赋得玉巵无当","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共惜连城宝，翻成无当巵。\n讵慙君子贵，深讶巧工隳。\n泛蚁功全小，如虹色不移。\n可怜殊砾石，何计辨糟醨。\n江海诚难满，盘筵莫忘施。\n纵乖斟酌意，犹得对光仪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}